@startuml
title S5 - Alternative charging point for displaced requests (UC-M4-07), called from UC-M3-08
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
participant "Sensor / iot_sim" as Sensor
control Core
control Charging
control Allocation
Sensor -> Core: Charging-point failure event
Core -> Charging: Domain event
Charging -> Charging: UC-M3-08: look for a free port in the same Hub
alt Free port in the same Hub
  Charging -> Charging: Reassign the session or re-queue (M3 only)
else No free port at this Hub
  Charging -> Core: Ask for alternatives for the displaced requests
  Core -> Allocation: find_alternative_charging(requests, current Hub) [read-only]
  Allocation -> Core: Read network snapshot
  Core --> Allocation: Free charging bays per Hub, as_of
  Allocation -> Allocation: Order requests (BR-M4-01, then BR-M3-03 inside the charging class)\nOffer each free bay to at most one request\nRank other Hubs by closeness, free bays, Hub ID
  alt Alternatives found
    Allocation --> Core: Alternative Hub and bay per request
  else Nothing free anywhere
    Allocation --> Core: NO_CHARGER (BR-M4-10)
  end
  Core --> Charging: Result
  Charging -> Charging: Move or re-queue sessions (M3 owns the failure handling)
end
note over Allocation: Read-only: no resource is held by M4.\nM3 confirms the new bay through its own flow.
@enduml
